{
  "workflowId": "300000331058561",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_OTM_RATE_INQUIRY_CTX_ASSISTANT_TEMPLATE",
  "name": "OTM Rate Inquiry Assistant",
  "description": "A workflow designed for performing OTM Rate Inquiry helping you quickly find shipping options and rates. To get started, please provide the following required information: number of ship units, item ID, source ID, and destination ID. You may also include optional details such as per ship unit weight and per ship unit volume for more accurate results.\nYou can provide GID, XID or Name for item, source and destination locations.\nYou can ask for all available options, the fastest transit, or the lowest cost shipping solutions.",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777037075838"
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize Results"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_RESULTS",
          "id": "1765400776945",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765400776949_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given a JSON response of the following structure (example below) from {{$context.$nodes.RIQ_BY_LOCATION_GID.$output}} . Your task is to deconstruct the rateAndRouteResponse array, and for each main object, output a clean, readable HTML table. Additionally below the table, provide a brief summary of the result and mention where this rate inquiry ship from and to first (all results are using the same origin and destination). Do not explain anything about time conversion.\n\nThe table must these columns in this order:\n1. Total Actual Cost\n2. Cost Per Unit\n3. Transit Time\n4. Transport Mode\n5. Service Provider\n6. Rate Offering\n7. Equipment Group\n8. Itinerary\n9. Per Shit Unit Weight\n10. Per Shit Unit Volume\n\nUse values in the following path for each column:\nTotal Actual Cost: totalActualCost.value + totalActualCost.currency (e.g., \"999.99 USD\")\nCost Per Unit: costPerUnit.value + costPerUnit.currency (e.g., \"99 USD\")\nTransit Time: Convert transitTime.amount + transitTime.type (e.g., \"9.9 H\") to days (D), hours (H) and minutes (M). \nTransport Mode: transportMode.transportModeGid\nService Provider: serviceProvider.servprovGid\nRate Offering: primaryRateOffering.rateOfferingGid\nRate Record: primaryRateRecord.rateRecordGid\nEquipment Group: equipmentGroup.equipmentGroupGid\nItinerary: itinerary.itineraryGid\nPer Shit Unit Weight: {{$context.$variables.weight}} {{$context.$variables.weightUnit}} \nPer Shit Unit Volume: {{$context.$variables.volume}} {{$context.$variables.volumeUnit}} \n\nIgnore any field named links.\nIf any value is missing, leave the cell blank.\nReturn the result as an HTML <table> with a single <thead> and <tbody>.\n\nExample JSON:\n{\n  \"rateAndRouteResponse\": [\n    {\n      \"totalActualCost\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n        \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n      },\n      \"costPerUnit\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n        \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n      },\n      \"totalWeightedCost\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n        \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n      },\n      \"weightedCostPerUnit\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n        \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n      },\n      \"shipFrom\": {\n        \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"shipTo\": {\n        \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"transportMode\": {\n        \"transportModeGid\": \"DUMMY_TRANSPORTMODE\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"serviceProvider\": {\n        \"servprovGid\": \"DUMMY_SERVPROV\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"transitTime\": {\n        \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n        \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n      },\n      \"startTime\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"endTime\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"totalLeadTime\": {},\n      \"equipmentGroup\": {\n        \"equipmentGroupGid\": \"DUMMY_EQGROUPGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"itinerary\": {\n        \"itineraryGid\": \"DUMMY_ITINERARYGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"primaryShipmentSource\": {\n        \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"primaryShipmentDestination\": {\n        \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"primaryTotalCost\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n        \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n      },\n      \"primaryTransitTime\": {\n        \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n        \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n      },\n      \"estimatedArrivalTimeAtSource\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"estimatedDeparturelTimeAtSource\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"estimatedArrivalTimeAtDestination\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"estimatedDepartureTimeAtDestination\": {\n        \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n      },\n      \"primaryRateOffering\": {\n        \"rateOfferingGid\": \"DUMMY_ROGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"primaryRateRecord\": {\n        \"rateRecordGid\": \"DUMMY_RRGID\",\n        \"links\": [\n          {\n            \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n            \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"toShipments\": [\n        {\n          \"cost\": {\n            \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n            \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n          },\n          \"weightedCost\": {\n            \"value\": \"DUMMY_VALUE\",\n            \"currency\": \"DUMMY_CURRENCY\"\n          },\n          \"origin\": {\n            \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"destination\": {\n            \"locationGid\": \"DUMMY_LOCATIONGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"transportMode\": {\n            \"transportModeGid\": \"DUMMY_TRANSPORTMODE\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"serviceProvider\": {\n            \"servprovGid\": \"DUMMY_SERVPROVGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"transitTime\": {\n            \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n            \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n          },\n          \"startTime\": {\n            \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n          },\n          \"endTime\": {\n            \"value\": \"DUMMY_TIME\"\n          },\n          \"distance\": {\n            \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n            \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n          },\n          \"weight\": {\n            \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n            \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n          },\n          \"volume\": {\n            \"amount\": \"DUMMY_AMOUNT\",\n            \"type\": \"DUMMY_TYPE\"\n          },\n          \"rateOffering\": {\n            \"rateOfferingGid\": \"DUMMY_RATEOFFERINGGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"rateRecord\": {\n            \"rateRecordGid\": \"DUMMY_RATERECORDGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"equipmentGroup\": {\n            \"equipmentGroupGid\": \"DUMMY_EQUIPMENTGROUP\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"itineraryLeg\": {\n            \"itineraryLegId\": \"DUMMY_ITINERARYLEGID\",\n            \"links\": [\n              {\n                \"rel\": \"canonical\",\n                \"href\": \"DUMMY_HREF\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nSample Output:\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Total Actual Cost</th>\n      <th>Cost Per Unit</th>\n      <th>Transit Time</th>\n      <th>Transport Mode</th>\n      <th>Service Provider</th>\n      <th>Rate Offering</th>\n      <th>Rate Record</th>\n      <th>Equipment Group</th>\n      <th>Itinerary</th>\n      <th>Per Shit Unit Weight</th>\n      <th>Per Shit Unit Volume</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td><Total Actual Cost></td>\n      <td><Cost Per Unit></td>\n      <td><Transit Time></td>\n      <td><Transport Mode></td>\n      <td><Service Provider></td>\n      <td><Rate Offering></td>\n      <th><Rate Record></th>\n      <td><Equipment Group></td>\n      <td><Itinerary></td>\n      <td>Per Shit Unit Weight</td>\n      <td>Per Shit Unit Volume</td>\n    </tr>\n    ...\n  </tbody>\n</table>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Output itemGid"
