              "value": "Based on {{$context.$nodes.ASK_MANDATORY_INPUT_FIELDS.$feedbackRecieved}} , update the following fields as needed.\n\nCurrent values:\nitemName: {{$context.$nodes.OTM_RIQ_EXTRACTION.$output.itemName}} \nshipUnitCount: {{$context.$nodes.OTM_RIQ_EXTRACTION.$output.shipUnitCount}} \nsourceLocationName: {{$context.$nodes.OTM_RIQ_EXTRACTION.$output.sourceLocationName}} \ndestLocationName: {{$context.$nodes.OTM_RIQ_EXTRACTION.$output.destLocationName}}\n\nInstructions:\n- Carefully read the user’s feedback and identify any updates for the values above.\n- Only change the values mentioned by the user; keep all other values unchanged.\n- Convert itemName, sourceLocationName and destLocationName to uppercase.\n- Output itemName, shipUnitCount, sourceLocationName, and destLocationName."
